                "retweet_count": 21,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Republican budget would leave families, children, seniors, people with disabilities, and everyone else who depends on Medicaid out in the cold by stripping them of their health coverage.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nWe will not stop fighting for Medicaid and the millions of Americans who rely on it. https://t.co/e9yJPpZl1N",
