                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The nonpartisan Congressional Budget Office reported the Republican Budget Bill will strip health care coverage from 16 million Americans.\n\u00a0\nRepublicans chose tax breaks for billionaires instead of health care for working families.  https://t.co/shjxVVXC9K",
