                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Joined providers and staff at Trinity Health to hear from them about the impacts that Republicans\u2019 cuts to Medicaid would have on our hospitals, patients, and communities \u2014 especially to maternal and postpartum care. \n\nOne thing is clear: if this bill becomes law, people will die.",
